 "_doc": "SOFT per-world defaults (never requirements). A scene's own `treat`/`medium`/`biome` always wins; `\"treat\": \"none\"` removes the default. `tags` describe what the world looks like, used by the intent check (pipeline/story/intent.py) to suggest a better world, never to block one.",
